651
00:53:40.000 --> 00:53:40.990
<font color=#FFFF00>I'm looking for her.</font>

652
00:53:41.080 --> 00:53:43.640
<font color=#FFFF00>Almira, they're coming towards me.
I hear them.</font>

653
00:53:47.240 --> 00:53:49.675
