661
00:54:45.880 --> 00:54:47.030
<font color=#FFFF00>Hey, there.</font>

662
00:55:00.280 --> 00:55:01.430
<font color=#FFFF00>You hear that?</font>

663
00:55:03.520 --> 00:55:04.795
