664
00:55:07.640 --> 00:55:08.869
<font color=#FFFF00>Nothing.</font>

665
00:55:09.520 --> 00:55:11.159
<font color=#FFFF00>No one is coming.</font>

666
00:55:11.240 --> 00:55:12.230
<font color=#FFFF00>(CHUCKLES)</font>

667
00:55:12.880 --> 00:55:15.440
<font color=#FFFF00>Just you and me.</font>

668
00:55:17.280 --> 00:55:19.397
<font color=#FFFF00>Phillip can't beat Ivan.</font>

669
00:55:21.000 --> 00:55:22.400
<font color=#FFFF00>Never could.</font>

670
00:55:28.560 --> 00:55:30.119
<font color=#FFFF00>(BOTH GRUNTING)</font>

671
00:55:45.800 --> 00:55:47.200
<font color=#FFFF00>(SUZANNE GRUNTING)</font>

672
00:55:58.920 --> 00:56:00.752
<font color=#FFFF00>(IVAN LAUGHING)</font>

673
00:56:06.680 --> 00:56:08.273
<font color=#FFFF00>(YELLING)</font>

674
00:56:10.640 --> 00:56:12.552
<font color=#FFFF00>(BOTH GRUNTING)</font>

675
00:56:46.000 --> 00:56:46.990
<font color=#FFFF00>(COUGHS)</font>

676
00:56:49.160 --> 00:56:50.150
