776
01:05:21.840 --> 01:05:23.194
<font color=#FFFF00>(METAL CLANGING)</font>

777
01:05:32.520 --> 01:05:36.196
<font color=#FFFF00>What does this crazy man do?
Your friend, Phillip? Huh?</font>

778
01:05:36.400 --> 01:05:38.551
