781
01:05:44.160 --> 01:05:46.072
<font color=#FFFF00>Does he take him out?</font>

782
01:05:46.400 --> 01:05:50.553
<font color=#FFFF00>No, not Phillip. He changes his identity.</font>

783
01:05:50.640 --> 01:05:54.156
<font color=#FFFF00>He needs to get close to Dimitri Petrovic.</font>

784
01:06:00.440 --> 01:06:02.557
<font color=#FFFF00>(CHATTERING VOICES ECHOING)</font>

785
01:06:06.080 --> 01:06:07.833
<font color=#FFFF00>(MEN GRUNTING)</font>

786
01:07:16.120 --> 01:07:17.110
<font color=#FFFF00>(SPEAKING SERBIAN)</font>

787
01:07:17.200 --> 01:07:18.429
<font color=#FFFF00>Looks good!</font>

788
01:07:26.280 --> 01:07:27.509
<font color=#FFFF00>Dusan...</font>

789
01:07:42.840 --> 01:07:44.194
<font color=#FFFF00>(SKIN BURNING)</font>

790
01:08:06.000 --> 01:08:07.354
<font color=#FFFF00>(INAUDIBLE)</font>

791
01:08:31.600 --> 01:08:37.517
<font color=#FFFF00>So he moves in, moves in and waits
