794
01:08:52.000 --> 01:08:53.719
<font color=#FFFF00>Then how did he...</font>

795
01:08:53.800 --> 01:08:58.511
<font color=#FFFF00>Well, you buy it
or in his case you take it by force.</font>

796
01:08:59.560 --> 01:09:03.918
<font color=#FFFF00>He was a Bosnian Serb
