798
01:09:10.040 --> 01:09:11.474
<font color=#FFFF00>using the government funds,</font>

799
01:09:11.560 --> 01:09:15.156
<font color=#FFFF00>at the same time
that he was climbing the political ladder.</font>

800
01:09:17.240 --> 01:09:18.560
<font color=#FFFF00>SUZANNE: Hmm.</font>

801
01:09:19.080 --> 01:09:21.879
<font color=#FFFF00>When Yugoslavia fell it was complete mayhem.</font>

802
01:09:21.960 --> 01:09:23.474
<font color=#FFFF00>And Petrovic capitalised.</font>

803
01:09:23.560 --> 01:09:26.997
<font color=#FFFF00>- He took control over the arms in Serbia.
- SANDERS: (CHUCKLES) Yeah.</font>

804
01:09:27.080 --> 01:09:30.357
<font color=#FFFF00>And you control all the weapons,
